    {
      "traditional": "王先生每天跟他太太一起吃晚飯。",
      "simplified": "王先生每天跟他太太一起吃晚饭。",
      "pinyin": "Wáng xiānsheng měitiān gēn tā tàitai yìqǐ chī wǎn fàn.",
      "english": "Mr. Wang has dinner with his wife every day.",
      "notes": "",
      "words_used": [
